# Text files have Unix line ends in the repository and in every working
# copy, on Windows too, so that files made by the tools and files checked
# byte for byte are the same everywhere (review 134, H8).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Models, pictures, and sounds are never text, whatever their first bytes
# look like.
*.glb binary
*.bin binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.hdr binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
# HoloML documents are tested byte for byte, line ends included
# (conformance/valid/syntax-forms.holoml uses Windows line ends on
# purpose), so Git must never convert them.
*.holoml -text
